    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad0037a4cd035.03574885\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Looting all the Sturdy Chests in the Labyrinth of Kindo'jan will allow you to quickly level up your reputation and earn some awesome rewards!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/delves/labyrinth-of-kindojan-megadelve-nemesis-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Labyrinth of Kindo'jan</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_cape_armor_troll_d_01.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><h2 id=\"sturdy-chests\" class=\"heading-size-2 heading-bar\"><span data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Sturdy Chests</span></h2>44 Sturdy Chests are located inside the Labyrinth of Kindo'jan and looting all of them will earn you the <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"achievement\" data-entity=\"achievement\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=63717/kindojans-labyrinth-discoveries\"><img alt=\"Kindo'jan's Labyrinth Discoveries\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_special_treasure_c_01.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Kindo'jan's Labyrinth Discoveries</span></a> achievement and the <a data-entity=\"title\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/title/treasure-hound-1336\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Treasure Hound %s</span></a> title. You can loot these once per account, which awards you 150 reputation for the Labyrinth of Kindo'jan activity, as well as some <a class=\"icontiny q1\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"currency\" data-entity=\"currency\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/currency=3316/voidlight-marl\"><span><img alt=\"Voidlight Marl\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_112_raidtrinkets_voidprism.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Voidlight Marl</span></span></a>, <a class=\"icontiny q1\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"currency\" data-entity=\"currency\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/currency=3448/corrosive-coin\"><span><img alt=\"Corrosive Coin\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/8032876.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Corrosive Coin</span></span></a>, and <a class=\"icontiny q1\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"currency\" data-entity=\"currency\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/currency=2803/undercoin\"><span><img alt=\"Undercoin\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_elvencoins.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Undercoin</span></span></a>.<br><br>20 Sturdy Chests are located in the 9 main chambers and do not have reputation requirements. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"markup-columns exclude-units\" data-split=\"half\"><div class=\"markup-columns-tracks\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><div class=\"markup-columns-column\"><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"mapper\" data-mapsize=\"normal\" style=\"width: 488px;\"><span class=\"mapper-map lazy-load-background\" id=\"sjdhfkljawelis0\" style=\"max-width: 488px; max-height: 325px; background: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/maps/enus/normal/16913-0_162891.jpg?1791976965&quot;);\"><div class=\"mapper-overlay\"><div class=\"mapper-overlay-expander\"></div></div><span class=\"mapper-zoom-tip\">Tip: Click map to zoom</span><div><div class=\"pin pin-3\" style=\"left: 37.1%; top: 69.8%;\"><a href=\"javascript:\" style=\"cursor: default;\"></a></div><div class=\"pin pin-3\" style=\"left: