></div><div class=\"pin pin-3\" style=\"left: 40.7%; top: 45.7%;\"><a href=\"javascript:\" style=\"cursor: default;\"></a></div><div class=\"pin pin-3\" style=\"left: 47.6%; top: 40.3%;\"><a href=\"javascript:\" style=\"cursor: default;\"></a></div></div></span><div class=\"wh-button-group\" style=\"position: absolute; right: 3px; top: 3px;\"><button class=\"wh-button zam-button\" type=\"button\" data-size=\"small\" data-style=\"primary\" data-variation=\"live\" style=\"float: right;\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\">Hide pins</span></button></div><span class=\"mapper-zone-link\" style=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/zone=16913/the-labyrinth-of-kindojan\">The Labyrinth of Kindo'jan</a>: The Labyrinth of Kindo'jan</span></div></div></div><div class=\"markup-columns-column\"><pre class=\"code exclude-units last\"><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 1 (Chamber of Rites)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;37.1&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;69.8&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 37.1 69.8 Ancient Chest 1 (Chamber of Rites)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 2 (Chamber of Rites)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;47.0&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;64.3&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 47.0 64.3 Ancient Chest 2 (Chamber of Rites)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 3 (Reliquary)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;30.0&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;74.1&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 30.0 74.1 Ancient Chest 3 (Reliquary)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 4 (Reliquary)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;22.0&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;68.6&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 22.0 68.6 Ancient Chest 4 (Reliquary)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 5 (Halazzi's Lair)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;13.8&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;35.5&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 13.8 35.5 Ancient Chest 5 (Halazzi's Lair)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 6 (Halazzi's Lair)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;26.2&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;40.3&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 26.2 40.3 Ancient Chest 6 (Halazzi's Lair)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 7 (Catacombs)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;72.3&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;65.6&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 72.3 65.6 Ancient Chest 7 (Catacombs)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 8 (Catacombs)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;69.6&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;70.9&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 69.6 70.9 Ancient Chest 8 (Catacombs)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 9 (The Cave Towers)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;87.0&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;63.0&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 87.0 63.0 Ancient Chest 9 (The Cave Towers)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 10 (The Cave Towers)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;81.5&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;55.4&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 81.5 55.4 Ancient Chest 10 (The Cave Towers)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 11 (Akil'zon's Roost)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;40.6&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;20.7&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 40.6 20.7 Ancient Chest 11 (Akil'zon's Roost)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 12 (Akil'zon's Roost)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;45.4&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;11.7&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 45.4 11.7 Ancient Chest 12 (Akil'zon's Roost)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 13 (Nalorakk's Rest)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;68.4&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;33.8&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 68.4 33.8 Ancient Chest 13 (Nalorakk's Rest)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 14 (Nalorakk's Rest)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;67.5&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;27.7&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 67.5 27.7 Ancient Chest 14 (Nalorakk's Rest)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 15 (Jan'alai's Refuge)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;22.4&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;29.4&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 22.4 29.4 Ancient Chest 15 (Jan'alai's Refuge)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 16 (Jan'alai's Refuge)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;21.5&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;36.4&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 21.5 36.4 Ancient Chest 16 (Jan'alai's Refuge)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 17 (Jan'alai's Refuge)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;28.5&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;22.9&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 28.5 22.9 Ancient Chest 17 (Jan'alai's Refuge)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 18 (The Central Chamber)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;45.8&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;48.0&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 45.8 48.0 Ancient Chest 18 (The Central Chamber)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 19 (The Central Chamber)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;40.7&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;45.7&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 40.7 45.7 Ancient Chest 19 (The Central Chamber)</span><br><span class=\"tip\" data-map-pin-json=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ancient Chest 20 (The Central Chamber)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:&quot;47.6&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:&quot;40.3&quot;,&quot;uiMapId&quot;:&quot;2647&quot;}\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">/<wbr>way #2647 47.6 40.3 Ancient Chest 20 (The Central Chamber)</span></pre></div></div></div></div><br><br>5 more Sturdy Chests can be found in a Secret location that also does not have any reputation requirements. Check out our <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/delves/labyrinth-of-kindojan-megadelve-nemesis-rewards\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Labyrinth guide</a> if you want details on the secret location, but an NPC gives you a clue to its location if you listen closely. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305625.png\" id=\"1305625\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305625.png?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Sturdy Chest\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.77778 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>The remaining 19 chests are locked away behind Sealed doors. Each door will unlock at Renown 3, Renown 5, Renown 7, or Renown 9, depending on the type of door. Once you unlock each room, it'll be marked on your map, so make sure to head over and claim your rewards!<h2 id=\"other-rewards\" class=\"heading-size-2 heading-bar\"><span data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Other Rewards</span></h2>Some Sturdy Chests also contain other rewards such as Transmogs or Toys! Check out the full list in our <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/delves/labyrinth-of-kindojan-megadelve-nemesis-rewards#discoveries-ancient-and-mislaid-chests\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Labyrinth Guide</a>, but here are some of the rewards!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"entity-model-card-embed-wrapper\"></div><div class=\"entity-model-card-embed-wrapper\"></div><div class=\"entity-model-card-embed-wrapper\"></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Looting all the Sturdy Chests in the Labyrinth of Kindo'jan will allow you to quickly level up your reputation and earn some awesome rewards!<br /><br />Labyrinth of Kindo'jan<br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Sturdy Chests</h2><br /><br />44 Sturdy Chests are located inside the Labyrinth of Kindo'jan and looting all of them will earn you the <a href=\"/achievement=63717/kindojans-labyrinth-discoveries\">Kindo'jan's Labyrinth Discoveries</a> achievement and the title. You can loot these once per account, which awards you 150 reputation for the Labyrinth of Kindo'jan activity, as well as some <a href=\"/currency=3316/voidlight-marl\">Voidlight Marl</a>, <a href=\"/currency=3448/corrosive-coin\">Corrosive Coin</a>, and <a href=\"/currency=2803/undercoin\">Undercoin</a>.<br /><br />20 Sturdy Chests are located in the 9 main chambers and do not have reputation requirements. <br /><br />Ancient Chest 1 (Chamber of Rites)<br />Ancient Chest 2 (Chamber of Rites)<br />Ancient Chest 3 (Reliquary)<br />Ancient Chest 4 (Reliquary)<br />Ancient Chest 5 (Halazzi's Lair)<br />Ancient Chest 6 (Halazzi's Lair)<br />Ancient Chest 7 (Catacombs)<br />Ancient Chest 8 (Catacombs)<br />Ancient Chest 9 (The Cave Towers)<br />Ancient Chest 10 (The Cave Towers)<br />Ancient Chest 11 (Akil'zon's Roost)<br />Ancient Chest 12 (Akil'zon's Roost)<br />Ancient Chest 13 (Nalorakk's Rest)<br />Ancient Chest 14 (Nalorakk's Rest)<br />Ancient Chest 15 (Jan'alai's Refuge)<br />Ancient Chest 16 (Jan'alai's Refuge)<br />Ancient Chest 17 (Jan'alai's Refuge)<br />Ancient Chest 18 (The Central Chamber)<br />Ancient Chest 19 (The Central Chamber)<br />Ancient Chest 20 (The Central Chamber)<br /><br />/way #2647 37.1 69.8 Ancient Chest 1 (Chamber of Rites)<br />/way #2647 47.0 64.3 Ancient Chest 2 (Chamber of Rites)<br />/way #2647 30.0 74.1 Ancient Chest 3 (Reliquary)<br />/way #2647 22.0 68.6 Ancient Chest 4 (Reliquary)<br />/way #2647 13.8 35.5 Ancient Chest 5 (Halazzi's Lair)<br />/way #2647 26.2 40.3 Ancient Chest 6 (Halazzi's Lair)<br />/way #2647 72.3 65.6 Ancient Chest 7 (Catacombs)<br />/way #2647 69.6 70.9 Ancient Chest 8 (Catacombs)<br />/way #2647 87.0 63.0 Ancient Chest 9 (The Cave Towers)<br />/way #2647 81.5 55.4 Ancient Chest 10 (The Cave Towers)<br />/way #2647 40.6 20.7 Ancient Chest 11 (Akil'zon's Roost)<br />/way #2647 45.4 11.7 Ancient Chest 12 (Akil'zon's Roost)<br />/way #2647 68.4 33.8 Ancient Chest 13 (Nalorakk's Rest)<br />/way #2647 67.5 27.7 Ancient Chest 14 (Nalorakk's Rest)<br />/way #2647 22.4 29.4 Ancient Chest 15 (Jan'alai's Refuge)<br />/way #2647 21.5 36.4 Ancient Chest 16 (Jan'alai's Refuge)<br />/way #2647 28.5 22.9 Ancient Chest 17 (Jan'alai's Refuge)<br />/way #2647 45.8 48.0 Ancient Chest 18 (The Central Chamber)<br />/way #2647 40.7 45.7 Ancient Chest 19 (The Central Chamber)<br />/way #2647 47.6 40.3 Ancient Chest 20 (The Central Chamber)<br /><br />5 more Sturdy Chests can be found in a Secret location that also does not have any reputation requirements. Check out our Labyrinth guide if you want details on the secret location, but an NPC gives you a clue to its location if you listen closely. <br /><br />The remaining 19 chests are locked away behind Sealed doors. Each door will unlock at Renown 3, Renown 5, Renown 7, or Renown 9, depending on the type of door. Once you unlock each room, it'll be marked on your map, so make sure to head over and claim your rewards!<br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Other Rewards</h2><br /><br />Some Sturdy Chests also contain other rewards such as Transmogs or Toys! Check out the full list in our Labyrinth Guide, but here are some of the rewards!<br /><br /><a href=\"/item=284051/hexbearers-pauldrons\">Hexbearer's Pauldrons</a><a href=\"/item=284052/amani-effigy\">Amani Effigy</a><a href=\"/item=284057/effigy-of-corrosion\">Effigy of Corrosion</a></noscript>            \n        ",
