    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad0026af05cd7.62362330\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">With the events of the Patch 12.1.5 campaign, new cosmetic items are available for players. Spoilers ahead.<br><br><div class=\"markup-grid exclude-units\" data-align=\"centered\" style=\"--markup-gridColumnBasis: 800px;\"><div class=\"last\" style=\"border:2px solid red; padding:10px;\"><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><b>The cosmetics ahead are spoilers for the Patch 12.1.5 campaign. If you haven't watched the cinematics yet and plan to, don't scroll down.</b></div></div></div><br><br>Two new items are available from the end of the Patch 12.1.5 campaign: <a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=274934/blade-of-the-blood-knight-matriarch\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Blade of the Blood Knight Matriarch\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_1h_artifactvigfus_d_01.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Blade of the Blood Knight Matriarch</span></a> and <a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=274937/shield-of-the-blood-knight-matriarch\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Shield of the Blood Knight Matriarch\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_1h_zuldazarraid_d_01.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Shield of the Blood Knight Matriarch</span></a>. These items are cosmetic and will be awarded from the final questline of the Patch 12.1.5 campaign, <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/quest=95813/what-the-world-sees\"><img alt=\"What the World Sees\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start-campaign.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">What the World Sees</span></a>.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"entity-model-card-embed-wrapper\"></div><div class=\"entity-model-card-embed-wrapper\"></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>With the events of the Patch 12.1.5 campaign, new cosmetic items are available for players. Spoilers ahead.<br /><br /> <b>The cosmetics ahead are spoilers for the Patch 12.1.5 campaign. If you haven't watched the cinematics yet and plan to, don't scroll down.</b> <br /><br />Two new items are available from the end of the Patch 12.1.5 campaign: <a href=\"/item=274934/blade-of-the-blood-knight-matriarch\">Blade of the Blood Knight Matriarch</a> and <a href=\"/item=274937/shield-of-the-blood-knight-matriarch\">Shield of the Blood Knight Matriarch</a>. These items are cosmetic and will be awarded from the final questline of the Patch 12.1.5 campaign, <a href=\"/quest=95813/what-the-world-sees\">What the World Sees</a>.<br /><br /><a href=\"/item=274934/blade-of-the-blood-knight-matriarch\">Blade of the Blood Knight Matriarch</a><a href=\"/item=274937/shield-of-the-blood-knight-matriarch\">Shield of the Blood Knight Matriarch</a></noscript>            \n        ",
