    "badgeColor": "border-amber-500/60 bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300",
    "title": {
      "en": "World of Warcraft: Forever Highilghts Launch Dungeons in New Blizzard Video",
      "es": "World of Warcraft: Forever Highilghts lanza mazmorras en el nuevo vídeo de Blizzard"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "World of Warcraft: Forever Highilghts Launch Dungeons in New Blizzard Video...",
      "es": "World of Warcraft: Forever Highilghts lanza mazmorras en el nuevo vídeo de Blizzard..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad002d0631ac4.45204398\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has released a video covering the launch dungeons in WoW: Forever!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dungeons-overview-locations-details\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">New Forever Dungeons</span></a></div><br><br>This video highlights three of the nine new dungeons coming in WoW: Forever to help you on your leveling journey. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9AlEQvn4dlc/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 800px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 45%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div></div><br><br>This video highlights The Hall of Thanes, Ruins of Lordaeron and Excavation Site Wetlands.<br><br><span class=\"large-text\">Hall of Thanes</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Sits beneath the Throne of Ironforge.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">For Alliance characters, similar to Ragefire Chasm for Horde.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Dark Iron Dwarves have tunneled into the halls to loot Ironforge Kings.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Restless spirits also haunt the halls.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Ruins of Lordaeron</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The entire dungeon plays out across the castle and is crawling with Undead.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">This dungeon shows off Forever's new lighting system.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The entire dungeon sits outdoors, so the fog, lighting and shadows are highlighted.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Excavation Site: Wetlands</span><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">A dwarven expedition came out here to dig and things went sideways. Players are tasked with finding out what happened.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">This dungeon features tall grass which raptors nest in; some of them are stealthed.</div></li></ul></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has released a video covering the launch dungeons in WoW: Forever!<br /><br />New Forever Dungeons<br /><br />This video highlights three of the nine new dungeons coming in WoW: Forever to help you on your leveling journey. <br /><br />This video highlights The Hall of Thanes, Ruins of Lordaeron and Excavation Site Wetlands.<br /><br />Hall of Thanes<br /><br /><ul><li>Sits beneath the Throne of Ironforge.</li><li>For Alliance characters, similar to Ragefire Chasm for Horde.</li><li>Dark Iron Dwarves have tunneled into the halls to loot Ironforge Kings.</li><li>Restless spirits also haunt the halls.</li></ul><br /><br />Ruins of Lordaeron<br /><br /><ul><li>The entire dungeon plays out across the castle and is crawling with Undead.</li><li>This dungeon shows off Forever's new lighting system.</li><li>The entire dungeon sits outdoors, so the fog, lighting and shadows are highlighted.</li></ul><br /><br />Excavation Site: Wetlands<br /><br /><ul><li>A dwarven expedition came out here to dig and things went sideways. Players are tasked with finding out what happened.</li><li>This dungeon features tall grass which raptors nest in; some of them are stealthed.</li></ul></noscript>            \n        ",
    "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/55746-world-of-warcraft-forever-highilghts-launch-dungeons-in-new-blizzard-video.jpg",
