      "en": "Receive 2 Mounts for 12-Month Subscription - New Subscription Bonuses",
      "es": "Recibe 2 montos por una suscripción de 12 meses: nuevos bonos de suscripción"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Receive 2 Mounts for 12-Month Subscription - New Subscription Bonuses...",
      "es": "Recibe 2 montos por una suscripción de 12 meses - Nuevos bonos de suscripción..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad0032db48b41.88375083\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">2 new mounts are being awarded to players for having a 12-month subscription!<br><br>Players with a 12-month subscription have been awarded a new gift in their Battle.net Launcher. If you have a 12-month subscription, check the Gifts tab for a new gift. If you don't see anything there right away, try reloading your Battle.net Launcher.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305600.png\" id=\"1305600\"><img width=\"400\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305600.png\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Battle Net Gifts\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 0.633731 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>Claiming this gift will grant you the <a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=282657/ashen-dreadglider\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Ashen Dreadglider\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/7958551.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Ashen Dreadglider</span></a> and <a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=278743/giant-grrloc\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Giant Grrloc\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/7933423.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Giant Grrloc</span></a> mounts.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305604.jpg\" id=\"1305604\"><img width=\"400\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305604.jpg?maxWidth=400\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Ashen Dreadglider\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.77778 / 1;\"></a><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305603.jpg\" id=\"1305603\"><img width=\"400\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305603.jpg?maxWidth=400\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Giant Grrloc\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.77778 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>Blizzard normally announces subscription bonuses, such as the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/new-12-month-subscription-rewards-astral-aurochs-skyriding-mount-378876\" data-contiguous=\"true\">one from 2025</a>, so it's odd that players only learned about it when it showed up in their mailbox this time.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>2 new mounts are being awarded to players for having a 12-month subscription!<br /><br />Players with a 12-month subscription have been awarded a new gift in their Battle.net Launcher. If you have a 12-month subscription, check the Gifts tab for a new gift. If you don't see anything there right away, try reloading your Battle.net Launcher.<br /><br />Claiming this gift will grant you the <a href=\"/item=282657/ashen-dreadglider\">Ashen Dreadglider</a> and <a href=\"/item=278743/giant-grrloc\">Giant Grrloc</a> mounts.<br /><br />Blizzard normally announces subscription bonuses, such as the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/new-12-month-subscription-rewards-astral-aurochs-skyriding-mount-378876\">one from 2025</a>, so it's odd that players only learned about it when it showed up in their mailbox this time.</noscript>            \n        ",
