      "en": "WoW: Forever Beta Going Down for a Couple Hours",
      "es": "WoW: La beta de Forever bajará por un par de horas"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "WoW: Forever Beta Going Down for a Couple Hours...",
      "es": "WoW: La beta de Forever bajará por un par de horas..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad0043fcb8b02.07103109\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has announced that they are taking down the WoW: Forever Beta for a couple of hours for maintenance.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2382032/1\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">We’re taking the WoW Forever Beta offline in a few minutes for maintenance. We’re going to run some internal tests, and we don’t expect it to be down for more than a couple of hours.<br><br>Beta realms should go offline at 8:00 a.m. PDT.<br><br>We’ll see you on the other side!</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has announced that they are taking down the WoW: Forever Beta for a couple of hours for maintenance.<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">We’re taking the WoW Forever Beta offline in a few minutes for maintenance. We’re going to run some internal tests, and we don’t expect it to be down for more than a couple of hours.<br /><br />Beta realms should go offline at 8:00 a.m. PDT.<br /><br />We’ll see you on the other side!</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
